sops.workflow:
1. User -> Transportation Planner;
2. Transportation Planner -> Accommodation Planner;
3. Accommodation Planner -> Restaurant Planner
   Accommodation Planner -> Attractions Planner (in parallel);
4. Restaurant Planner, Attractions Planner -> Final Plan Summarizer;
5. Final Plan Summarizer -> End.

Description:
First, the Transportation Planner establishes the closed-loop route (Las Vegas -> Denver -> Las Vegas) for 3 days, selecting transportation modes within budget. The Accommodation Planner then secures single-occupancy stays in Denver for nights 1 and 2. Simultaneously, the Restaurant Planner books non-repeating solo-friendly meals, and the Attractions Planner schedules unique free activities. Finally, the Summarizer consolidates all details into a cohesive itinerary, validating against budget and solo-travel constraints.
